- ✅ `[GeneratedRegex]` used for 3 core patterns behind `#if NET7_0_OR_GREATER` — L13, L16, L19
- ✅ `RegexOptions.Compiled` fallback in `#else` block for downlevel — appropriate
- ✅ `IsAllUpperCase` uses `foreach` loop instead of LINQ `.All()` — L159
- ✅ `Slugify` uses `.ToLowerInvariant()` — L189
- ✅ `IsAsciiAlphanumeric` and `WordCount` use zero-allocation `foreach` over chars

